<title>USA: LodgeNet to offer $125 million in notes.</title>
<headline>LodgeNet to offer $125 million in notes.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS, S.D. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>LodgeNet Entertainment Corp said Tuesday it would offer $125 million in senior notes due 2006 to qualified investors in a private placement.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said it would enter into a new secured bank credit facility providing up to $100 million in revolving advances.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the notes and credit facility will be used to finance the expansion of the company's interactive entertainment and information services to the residential markets, LodgeNet said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
